# Fourth kan by a second seat, then pon attempted on its discard:
# Suukaikan aborts at row 4 AHEAD of any call at row 6 (engine.md §4.1 row 4, §4.2, rules.md §4.22).
# Seat 0 makes 3 closed kans (1m, 9m, 1p), discards 2z.
# Seat 1 makes the 4th kan (ankan 9p), draws rinshan 5z (no win), discards 5z.
# Seat 2 answers pon:55z -> pon is NOT made; round aborts as suukaikan!
# Deltas: 0 0 0 0; sticks: 0; honba: 1; dealer repeats.

[meta]
name: abort_suukaikan_second_seat_pon
title: Fourth kan by a second seat aborts ahead of a pon on the post-kan discard
rules: mahjongsoul
source: engine.md §4.1 row 4, §4.2, rules.md §4.22

[round]
wind: E
round: 1
honba: 0
sticks: 0
dealer: 0
scores: 25000 25000 25000 25000

[wall]
hand 0: 1111m 9999m 1111p 2z
hand 1: 9999p 234m 678m 234p
hand 2: 55z 345p 678p 234s 88s
hand 3: 456m 567s 1122s 666z
dora: 1z 2z 3z 4z 7z
rinshan: 3z 4z 4z 5z
draws: 2z 3z

[steps]
0 ankan 1m
0 ankan 9m
0 ankan 1p
0 discard 2z
1 ankan 9p
1 tsumogiri 5z
assert_legal 2: pon:55z
window: 2=pon:55z

[expect]
